{"version":1,"id":"huntr-x-what-it-sounds-like","title":"What It Sounds Like","artist":"HUNTR/X","key":"C#m","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/huntrx/what-it-sounds-like/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Jenna Andrews, Stephen Kirk and Mark Sonnenblick","chords":[{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"G#m","canonical":"G#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,11,3],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"Nothing but the truth now","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Nothing but the proof of what I am","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"The worst of what I came from","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Patterns I'm ashamed of, things that even I don’t understand","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"I tried to fix it, I tried to fight it","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"My head was twisted, my heart divided","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"My lies all collided, I don’t know why","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I didn’t trust you to be on my side","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I broke into a million pieces and I can’t go back","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"But now I’m seeing all the beauty in the broken glass","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"The scars are part of me, darkness and harmony","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"My voice without the lies, this is what it sounds like","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Why did I cover up the colors stuck inside my head?","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"I should’ve let the jagged edges meet the light instead","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Show me what’s underneath, I’ll find your harmony","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"The song we couldn’t write, this is what it sounds like","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"We're shattering the silence","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":7,"beat":1},{"symbol":"B","column":16,"beat":2},{"symbol":"G#m","column":24,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"We're rising defiant","columns":24,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":7,"beat":2},{"symbol":"B","column":16,"beat":4},{"symbol":"G#m","column":21,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Shouting in the quiet, you're not alone","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"We listened to the demons, we let them get between us","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"But none of us are out here on our own","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"So we were cowards, so we were liars","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"So we're not heroes, we're still survivors","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"The dreamers, the fighters, no lying, I'm tired","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"But dive in the fire and I'll be right here by your side","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"We broke into a million pieces and we can't go back","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#m","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"But now we're seeing all the beauty in the broken glass","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column